**Project Objectives

The main objective is to create a clear and engaging digital experience that encourages eligible Jobcentre customers to take part in the Movement to Work programme.

**The project objectives are to:

*Clearly explain the purpose of the Movement to Work programme
*Explain that the programme includes two weeks of supported work experience
*Show the six-day Monday-to-Wednesday schedule and approximate attendance times
*Clearly describe what participants will do during the programme
*Communicate the personal and professional benefits of taking part
*Help users recognise the transferable skills they already have
*Help participants develop new transferable and workplace skills
*Explain the one-to-one employability support available
*Highlight support with CVs, applications, cover letters and personal statements
*Explain how artificial intelligence can be used appropriately during job applications
*Introduce participants to different roles within the Jobcentre
*Provide information about local employers and employment sectors
*Include useful guidance about travel to local employment opportunities
*Encourage more eligible customers to register their interest
*Give Jobcentre staff a useful resource for explaining and promoting the programme
*Present the information in an accessible, mobile-friendly and easy-to-follow format
